WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:02.420
(jazz music)

00:00:04.474 --> 00:00:06.648
- When I first started in the wig business

00:00:06.648 --> 00:00:10.315
the hair alone could
be up to $175 an ounce.

00:00:11.873 --> 00:00:15.640
Let's just say, there was more
money in hair than heroin.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:16.977
My stock of hair right now

00:00:16.977 --> 00:00:20.394
is probably worth over a million dollars.

00:00:22.612 --> 00:00:25.805
My name is Nicholas
Piazza, and I'm a wigmaker,

00:00:25.805 --> 00:00:27.620
hair stylist, wig designer.

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.322
I started doing wigs almost
from the beginning of my career.

00:00:31.322 --> 00:00:33.626
This is my 50th year actually.

00:00:33.626 --> 00:00:35.882
These are some covers that I'd done

00:00:35.882 --> 00:00:37.633
for some beauty magazine.

00:00:37.633 --> 00:00:41.509
I used two pounds of hair
to create this style.

00:00:41.509 --> 00:00:43.868
I worked for the Kenneth Beauty Salon,

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:46.704
which was at that time, world-renowned,

00:00:46.704 --> 00:00:49.410
all the celebrities, all the movie stars,

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:51.475
including people like Jacqueline Onassis

00:00:51.475 --> 00:00:54.725
and Marilyn Monroe, were clients there.

00:00:55.979 --> 00:00:58.843
I opened my own salon
on the Upper East side.

00:00:58.843 --> 00:01:01.593
I was there from 1985 until 2010,

00:01:03.286 --> 00:01:06.814
and I moved into the salon
I'm in today at Gloria Wan.

00:01:06.814 --> 00:01:07.948
Did you wash this wig?

00:01:07.948 --> 00:01:09.406
- [Woman] No, I didn't.

00:01:09.406 --> 00:01:11.932
- Okay, let me cut it and then wash it.

00:01:11.932 --> 00:01:14.988
So, it takes about five or
six weeks to make a wig.

00:01:14.988 --> 00:01:17.978
The job of crocheting the
hair is called ventilating it.

00:01:17.978 --> 00:01:20.905
The ventilating needles
come in different sizes,

00:01:20.905 --> 00:01:23.286
so if we're doing very
fine work they'll use

00:01:23.286 --> 00:01:26.865
a needle that only takes one
or two hairs in each knot.

00:01:26.865 --> 00:01:28.912
And if we're using a heavy wig,

00:01:28.912 --> 00:01:29.776
we might have a needle

00:01:29.776 --> 00:01:33.111
that takes up to 10 hairs in each knot.

00:01:33.111 --> 00:01:35.982
Sometimes the more delicate
wigs actually take longer

00:01:35.982 --> 00:01:38.671
than the very thick ones.

00:01:38.671 --> 00:01:41.312
At one time there was
the synthetic wig boom,

00:01:41.312 --> 00:01:44.115
and everybody had a
synthetic wig, and now,

00:01:44.115 --> 00:01:47.594
people seem to be much more
interested in the quality,

00:01:47.594 --> 00:01:50.009
and they're willing to
spend the money for it.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:53.676
My custom wigs range
from $38.50 up to $5000.

00:01:54.819 --> 00:01:56.576
You know, and I've made wigs for films

00:01:56.576 --> 00:01:58.484
that I've had to charge
more than that for,

00:01:58.484 --> 00:01:59.947
because I had to do them in a hurry

00:01:59.947 --> 00:02:03.656
and pay through the nose to get it done.

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:06.363
My clients are a variety of people.

00:02:06.363 --> 00:02:07.885
It's the kind of thing where

00:02:07.885 --> 00:02:11.129
you get a lot of satisfaction
when you have clients that

00:02:11.129 --> 00:02:12.969
are undergoing medical treatments.

00:02:12.969 --> 00:02:15.307
Sometimes, it had actually held them back

00:02:15.307 --> 00:02:16.804
from getting their medical treatments

00:02:16.804 --> 00:02:19.722
if they told that they
were gonna have hair loss.

00:02:19.722 --> 00:02:22.416
And then once they got
the wig and they saw that

00:02:22.416 --> 00:02:25.665
they looked as good, or
in many cases even better

00:02:25.665 --> 00:02:27.199
than they looked before,

00:02:27.199 --> 00:02:31.875
they go into their treatments
with a lot better attitude.

00:02:31.875 --> 00:02:34.594
I don't know what sets me apart.

00:02:34.594 --> 00:02:36.333
I care about what I do,

00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:38.094
and also I know I'm good at it,

00:02:38.094 --> 00:02:42.261
and when you're good at
something, you enjoy doing it.

